.TH MODDEC 1
.SH NAME
moddec \- command-line tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B moddec
.SH DESCRIPTION
Decode S3M, IT and MPTM files to f32le stereo PCM at 48000 Hz
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bin/moddec [flags] [file]
.SH OPTIONS
  -f string
    path to module file (default: stdin) (default "-")
  -noloop
    stop when song playback repeats (sample and finite pattern loops are preserved)
  -seq int
    zero-based MPTM sequence index
  -v	Enable verbose output
